## Interactive Elements

### Tooltips

Tooltips provide additional information on hover without cluttering the UI.

```jsx
// Tooltip container
{
  position: 'absolute',
  bottom: '100%',
  left: '50%',
  transform: 'translateX(-50%)',
  marginBottom: '6px',
  backgroundColor: '#333',
  color: 'white',
  fontSize: '10px',
  padding: '4px 8px',
  borderRadius: '4px',
  whiteSpace: 'nowrap',
  zIndex: '10'
}

